# Copy to .env (gitignored). Read only by the Slidev dev server and
# `pnpm follow`; never sent to the browser. The hosted deck's Worker has its
# own copies of the webhooks, as Worker secrets (see wrangler.jsonc).

# Discord webhooks, for trying the post buttons under `pnpm dev`. Server
# settings → Integrations → Webhooks → New Webhook → Copy Webhook URL.
# DogDays (Next.js) channel:
DISCORD_SNIPPETS_WEBHOOK_WEB=""
# DogPack (Flutter) channel:
DISCORD_SNIPPETS_WEBHOOK_MOBILE=""

# Demo laptops only (`pnpm follow`, LAYOUTS.md "Presenting").

# The workshop clone the demo is typed into, which checkpoints switch.
# `pnpm follow <track> <path>` overrides it.
SLIDES_DEMO_REPO=""

# The live relay to follow. Defaults to https://slides-relay.devdogsuga.org;
# point it at `wrangler dev` (http://localhost:8787) to try the relay locally.
SLIDES_LIVE_URL=""
